WEBVTT

00:00:01.450 --> 00:00:05.133
This path is for people leaders of US non-exempt employees.

00:00:05.133 --> 00:00:09.066
Your review and approval keep every hour on the right paycheck.

00:00:10.416 --> 00:00:16.349
The Fair Labor Standards Act requires Cisco to track hours worked for non-exempt employees.

00:00:16.349 --> 00:00:22.021
Accurate timecards support compliance, operational efficiency, and employee well-being.

00:00:23.371 --> 00:00:27.368
Employees record the hours they work in Workday, every day.

00:00:27.368 --> 00:00:32.651
That record is how payroll pays regular time, overtime, and on-call correctly.

00:00:34.001 --> 00:00:36.941
You review, validate, and approve those timecards.

00:00:36.941 --> 00:00:41.937
You also make sure your team knows the program, the deadlines, and where to get help.

00:00:43.287 --> 00:00:45.461
This path takes about fifteen minutes.

00:00:45.461 --> 00:00:52.781
You will cover the policy your team follows, your review responsibilities and the payroll week, then the resources you can keep.
